    {
      "$type": "Models.Factorial.Experiment, Models",
      "DisabledSimNames": null,
      "Name": "Gatton24",
      "ResourceName": null,
      "Children": [
        {
          "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
          "Text": "**Gatton phenology trial:**\n\n* all treatments are irrigated - specific dates and amounts provided by Ian Lee Long    \n\n* only treatments without lights used  \n\n* phenology measurements up until the time of flowering only are recorded  \n\n* phenological stages will change in apsim as the lentil model is developed:  \n\nFrom AP: \"For the moment:  \nNextGen term ‘Start flowering’ – is actually 50% budding.  \nNextGen term ‘End flowering’ – is actually 50% flowering.  \nAnd I haven’t yet restructured to do a start podding.\"  \n\n**Met file** - taken from SILO (same as Jeremy Whish)  \n\n**Simulation started** 15/4, the day before the first irrigation.  \n\n\n**Soil properties** -  \n\n* Initial SW is unknown - set at 50%  \n\n* Lentil Soil properties may require fine-tuning",
          "Name": "Memo",
          "ResourceName": null,
          "Children": [],
          "Enabled": true,
          "ReadOnly": false
        },
        {
          "$type": "Models.Factorial.Factors, Models",
          "Name": "Factors",
          "ResourceName": null,
          "Children": [
            {
              "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
              "Text": "**Factors at Gatton phenology trial**\n\n***Time of sowing - ***\n\n1. 10 May, 2019  \n2. 7 June, 2019  \n3. 19 July, 2019  \n\n\n\n***Cultivar - numerous but we select the following subset to work on***  \n \nPBA Ace  \nPBA Blitz  \nPBA Bolt\nDigger  \nPBA Greenfield  \nPBA Hallmark XT  \nPBA Jumbo  \nNugget    \n",
              "Name": "Memo",
              "ResourceName": null,
              "Children": [],
              "Enabled": true,
              "ReadOnly": false
            },
